<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"DBP\u2019nin yeni e\u015fba\u015fkanlar\u0131 U\u00e7ar ve Bay\u0131nd\u0131r","articleSection":"Siyaset","dateCreated":"2023-11-12T15:27:00+03:00","datePublished":"2023-11-12T15:27:00+03:00","dateModified":"2023-11-12T15:30:01+03:00","wordCount":167,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com\/dbpnin-yen-esbaskanlari-ucar-ve-bayindir"},"articleBody":"DBP\u2019nin 6'nc\u0131 Ola\u011fan\u00fcst\u00fc Kongresi'nde yap\u0131lan se\u00e7imlerde \u00c7i\u011fdem K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7g\u00fcn U\u00e7ar ve Keskin Bay\u0131nd\u0131r yeni e\u015f genel ba\u015fkanlar olarak se\u00e7ildi.\r\n\r\nDemokratik B\u00f6lgeler Partisi (DBP), 6\u2019nc\u0131 Ola\u011fan\u00fcst\u00fc Kongresi\u2019ni Ankara D\u00fcnya Ticaret Merkezi\u2019nde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi. Kongrenin d\u00fczenlendi\u011fi salona, \u201cTecride hay\u0131r, bar\u0131\u015f hemen \u015fimdi\u201d, \u201cK\u00fcrt sorununda demokratik \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm\u201d, \u201cJin, jiyan, azad\u00ee\u201d ve \u201cZiwan\u00ea Kurdk\u00ee wa bibo ziwan\u00ea ferm\u00ee\u201d pankartlar\u0131 as\u0131ld\u0131. Bar\u0131\u015f Anneleri\u2019nin yan\u0131 s\u0131ra bir\u00e7ok sivil toplum \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fc temsilcisi ve yurtta\u015f kongreye kat\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\nPartinin 5 Kas\u0131m'da Amed\u2019te ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi\u011fi konferansta E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkanl\u0131k g\u00f6revi i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00c7i\u011fdem K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7g\u00fcn U\u00e7ar da kongrede konu\u015ftu. Ard\u0131ndan se\u00e7ime gidildi. Partinin Merkez Y\u00fcr\u00fctme Kurulu \u00fcyeleri se\u00e7ildi. Partinin yeni E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkanlar\u0131 da \u00c7i\u011fdem K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7g\u00fcn U\u00e7ar ve Keskin Bay\u0131nd\u0131r oldu.","description":"DBP\u2019nin 6'nc\u0131 Ola\u011fan\u00fcst\u00fc Kongresi'nde yap\u0131lan se\u00e7imlerde \u00c7i\u011fdem K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7g\u00fcn U\u00e7ar ve Keskin Bay\u0131nd\u0131r yeni e\u015f genel ba\u015fkanlar olarak se\u00e7ildi.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":["DBP","Kongre","U\u00e7ar","Bay\u0131nd\u0131r"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/guneydogueksprescom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/guneydoguekspres-com\/uploads\/2023\/11\/whatsapp-image-2023-11-12-at-133807.jpeg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"DBP\u2019nin yeni e\u015fba\u015fkanlar\u0131 U\u00e7ar ve Bay\u0131nd\u0131r"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com\/#organization","name":"G\u00fcneydo\u011fu Ekspres","image":"https:\/\/guneydogueksprescom.teimg.com\/guneydoguekspres-com\/uploads\/2025\/09\/guneydogu-ekspres-light.svg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/guneydogueksprescom.teimg.com\/guneydoguekspres-com\/uploads\/2025\/09\/guneydogu-ekspres-light.svg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"User 20","url":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com\/muhabir\/20\/user-20"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"User 20","url":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com\/muhabir\/20\/user-20"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com\/#organization","name":"G\u00fcneydo\u011fu Ekspres","url":"https:\/\/www.guneydoguekspres.com"}}</script>


